== Related risks

[TIP]
====
Create a risk if you identify a cyber threat — something that can cause harm by exploiting one or more vulnerabilities. If the risk is already in the risk register, link it instead.
====

{{#if risks}}

[caption=]
.Existing risks
[cols="5,2"]
|===
| Risk | Workflow State

{{#each risks}}
|xref:{{this.key}}.adoc[{{this.title}}]
|{{this.workflowState}}
{{/each}}

|===

Link or create another risk, if needed:
{{else}}
You have not yet created or linked any risks.
{{/if}}

{{#createLinks}}
  "buttonLabel": "Link risks",
  "linkType": "ismsa/linkTypes/presentsRisk",
  "direction": "outbound",
  "cardKey": "{{../cardKey}}",
  "query": {{#quoted}}
result(X) :- secdeva_closestProject({{{../cardKey}}}, Project), secdeva_closestProject(X, Project), base_projectCardType(X, "ismsa/cardTypes/risk").
select(1, "results", "title").
select(1, "results", "cardType").
order(1, "results", 1, "title", "ASC").
{{/quoted}}
{{/createLinks}}

{{#createCards}}
    "template": "secdeva/templates/productRisk2",
    "buttonLabel": "Create a risk",
    "cardKey": "{{riskRegister.key}}",
    "link": {
      "linkType": "ismsa/linkTypes/presentsRisk",
      "direction": "outbound",
      "cardKey": "{{../cardKey}}"
    }
{{/createCards}}

